{
  "name": "Error and Exception Handling",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9932)\n- Entry: authenticated webhook **POST /error** (onReceived). Callers on the success path may also invoke this workflow via Execute Workflow elsewhere; other workflows do not route n8n error outputs here (inline handlers only).\n- Payload: `{ errorId, message | details, retryCount?, maxRetries?, retrySafe? }`; test payload uses `message`.\n- Base URL: `$env.BACKEND_BASE_URL`.\n- **Classify:** POST `/v1/errors/classify` with `errorId` + message.\n- **Record:** POST `/v1/errors/record`; audit invalid/duplicate via `/v1/errors/event-record`.\n- **Retry safe:** POST `/v1/errors/schedule-retry`.\n- **Unsafe / exhausted:** POST `/v1/admin/exception-queue/tickets` then admin alert.\n- Duplicates: `errorId` in global static data (Remove Duplicates semantics).\n- Failures: POST `/v1/admin/team-alert`; Stop and Error.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "10000001-aaaa-bbbb-cccc-000000000001",
      "name": "Assumptions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
